[{:adr/authoritative_for ["shinshi-growth-actor (gftdcojp/shinshi-growth-actor, private) = growth-LLM ⊣\n    MarketingGovernor actor: itonami (Gftd Japan株式会社, cloud-itonami) が\n    club-shinshi (JK株式会社) に growth-loop-as-a-service を提供する新規クライアント\n    関係。既存3 actor (com-etzhayyim-kyoninka / gftd-talent-actor / cloud-itonami\n    自身) と同型の containment (sealed LLM ⊣ 独立 governor ⊣ 不変台帳)" "MarketingGovernor 不変条件: HARD=charter-clean(ダークパターン ヒューリスティック\n    床)・年齢確認/同意コピー不可侵・未知effect。SOFT=クリエイター取り分保護\n    (:ppv-terms-change またはGMV split示唆は常にescalate、confidence不問)・\n    high-stakes gate(#{:pricing-experiment :ad-spend-change :ppv-terms-change})・\n    confidence floor 0.7 (low-stakes auto-commitはPhase 3のみ)" "本ADRはPhase 0 (mock advisor + MemStore、ライブデータなし、実行なし) のみを\n    カバーする。Phase 1はai-gftd-shinshi内部D1 dispatch APIとのsecrets-sharing決定、\n    Phase 3の前段としてcloud-itonami ADR-0009のテナント/外部オンボーディングgap拡張が\n    それぞれ必要 — いずれも本ADRでは未解決のfollow-upとして明記するのみ"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "shinshi-growth-actor-itonami-client-service", :adr/related ["adr-2607021500-portfolio-seven-layer-business-model-lean-canvas" "adr-2607021900-portfolio-add-isekai-club-shinshi"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607040900-shinshi-growth-actor-itonami-client-service", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-12", :adr/body "# ADR-2607040900\n\n**Status**: accepted **Date**: 2026-07-04\n\n## Addendum (2026-07-12): Phase 1 landed — scoped read-only credential\n\nResolved the open Consequences question: club-shinshi mints a separate\nitonami-only scoped read-only credential (`GROWTH_ACTOR_READONLY_SECRET`)\nrather than sharing `DISPATCHER_INTERNAL_SECRET` — least-privilege, and the\nonly option compatible with Cloudflare Secrets Store write-only semantics.\nclub-shinshi side (commit `baa8551`): `/_metrics/revenue` and `/_d1` accept\neither secret; `/_d1` restricts the new secret to exactly `{read_metric\nread_revenue_gate}`, 403 on every write op and every read outside that\nallow-list. Deployed to production (`magatama-sh1n5h1x`/`shinshi.club`) and\nverified live. shinshi-growth-actor side (commit `ab7fe80`):\n`growth.facts/live-facts` + `fetch-live-facts!` are no longer a stub — call\nthe two endpoints via injected `http-fn`, secret from env var\n`SHINSHI_GROWTH_READONLY_SECRET`, honest-null preserved (upstream `null` →\n`nil`; transport/`{ok:false}` failure → explicit `:error` marker, never a\nfabricated number). `growth.phase` gained `:live-facts?` (true from Phase 1);\n`:writes`/`:auto` unchanged at every phase — strictly additive, no\nwrite/auto-commit gating changed, `growth.operation`/`growth.governor`/\n`growth.publisher`/`growth.aozora` untouched, `default-phase` stays 0.\nSecret generated once, stored in kagi (`kotoba-lang/kagi`, item\n`SHINSHI_GROWTH_ACTOR_READONLY_SECRET`, compartment `shinshi-growth`),\ndeployed via `wrangler secret put`, never committed to either repo. Phase 2/3\nstatus and the cloud-itonami tenant/external-onboarding gap are unchanged by\nthis addendum.\n\n## Addendum (2026-07-12, later same day): Phase 2 live-facts wiring + real aozora Publisher\n\nTwo more pieces landed the same day. Phase 2 live-facts wiring\n(`src/growth/live.clj`, landed by a separate concurrent session on this\nrepo): `growth.facts/live-facts` -> `facts->store-metrics` ->\n`growth.store/with-metrics` -> `growth.operation/build` is now a real,\nexercised path (`clojure -M:dev:run-live`) — a separate opt-in entry point,\n`growth.sim`'s own demo and `default-phase` (still 0) untouched. Real aozora\nPublisher (`src/growth/{cacao,aozora,publisher}.clj(c)`, commit\n`06e86bc`/`7c85372`): faithfully ported from club-shinshi's own\n`shinshi.cacao`/`shinshi.aozora` — per-actor Ed25519 identity + depth-1\nself-minted CACAO, real `pds.aozora.app` createSession/createRecord.\n`growth.operation/build` gained a `:publisher` opt (default: mock-publisher,\nzero regression); `:commit` calls `publish!` for governor-cleared\n`:marketing-copy`/`:creator-outreach` only, recording\n`growth.audit/published`/`growth.audit/publish-failed` without ever\nthrowing out of `:commit`. Collection `com.gftdcojp.apps.itonami.growthPost`\n— deliberately distinct from club-shinshi's own\n`com.etzhayyim.apps.shinshi.socialPost`, since this actor is itonami's own\nDID publishing on club-shinshi's behalf, not club-shinshi itself. Not done:\nno real LLM advisor wired (mock advisor still consumes the live facts; a\nreal model is a separate funding/config decision), no real post published\n(every test fakes `http-fn`/`Publisher`, no production `.growth/\nidentity.edn` was generated), governor gating fully unchanged.\n\n## Decision\n\n`gftdcojp/shinshi-growth-actor`(private) を growth-LLM ⊣ MarketingGovernor\nactor として新規作成。既存3 actor (kyoninka/talent/itonami自身) と同型の\ncontainment: growth-LLM は langgraph-clj StateGraph の単一ノードに封じ込め、\n提案は必ず独立 MarketingGovernor 経由でのみ SSoT へコミットされる。\n\nHARD invariants (人間でも上書き不可 → HOLD): (1) charter-clean\n(ダークパターン/誇大な緊急性・希少性/隠れ手数料/誤解を招く自動更新の\nヒューリスティック検出、完全なNLP分類器ではない床)。(2) 年齢確認/同意コピー\n不可侵 (ExoClick/アダルトコンテンツ コンプライアンス)。(3) 未知effect\n(スキーマ逸脱のfail closed拒否)。\n\nSOFT invariants (人間が判断、auto-commitには乗らない): (4) クリエイター取り分\n保護 — `:ppv-terms-change` またはGMV split変更を示唆する提案は confidence 不問で\n常にescalate。(5) high-stakes gate — `#{:pricing-experiment :ad-spend-change\n:ppv-terms-change}` は常に人間承認。(6) confidence floor 0.7 — low-stakes\n(`#{:content-experiment :marketing-copy :creator-outreach}`) のみ、違反なし\nかつconfidence>=0.7の場合に限りPhase 3でauto-commit対象。\n\nPhase 0→3 (`growth.phase`): 本ADRがカバーするのはPhase 0のみ(mock advisor +\nMemStore、ライブデータなし、実行なし)。Phase 1(読み取り専用ライブメトリクス)・\nPhase 2(実LLM、人間承認維持)・Phase 3(governor承認済みlow-stakesのauto-commit)\nはいずれも未実装のfollow-up。\n\nStoreは`MemStore`(既定)/`DatomicStore`(`langchain.db`の`:db-api`駆動)の2\nバックエンドを同一protocolで実装し contract testでMemStore≡DatomicStoreを保証。\n全レコードに`:growth.tenant/id \"club-shinshi\"`をタグ付け(スキーマレベルのみ、\n完全なテナントレジストリではない)。\n\n13 tests / 44 assertions / 0 failures、clj-kondo clean。\n\n## Consequences\n\n(+) growth-loopドメインにcontainmentパターンを拡張、Phase 0 scaffoldとして\n実データ・実secrets・実実行を一切含まず完結。(−) cloud-itonami ADR-0009の\nテナント/外部オンボーディングgapを解決しない限りclub-shinshiを本物のitonami\nホスト型テナントにはできない — 未解決のfollow-up。(−) Phase 1はai-gftd-shinshi\nの内部D1 dispatch API (`read_metric`/`read_revenue_gate`、`x-internal-trust`=\n`DISPATCHER_INTERNAL_SECRET`ゲート) とのcross-repo secrets-sharing決定が前提 —\n本ADRでは決定せず`growth.facts`はドキュメント化されたスタブのまま。\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-2607021500 (club-shinshi/itonami別法人の正本)\n- ADR-2607021900 (club-shinshi riskiest gate = creator-GMV-exceeds-ad-revenue)\n- `orgs/gftdcojp/ai-gftd-shinshi/docs/260613-bmc-lean.datoms.edn` (H1/H2 backlog)\n- `orgs/gftdcojp/cloud-itonami/docs/adr/0002-*.md` / `0009-*.md` (テナント分離・\n  外部オンボーディングgap)\n- 新規repo: https://github.com/gftdcojp/shinshi-growth-actor", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-04", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607040900: shinshi-growth-actor — itonami が club-shinshi に提供する growth-loop-as-a-service"}]